H("665.d.1.D",3,"Making eye contact, speaking clearly and arriving early show good:","interviewing skills",["shopping habits","driving skills","gaming skills"],"First impressions count.")
H("665.d.1.D",4,"Before a job-shadowing interview, a student should:","research the organization and practice answers",["arrive late","bring no questions","ignore dress code"],"Preparation shows interest.")
